                      prefix)
  snooze [options]    Snooze a scheduled or fired reminder
  update [options]    Update one field on a scheduled reminder
  log [options]       Show lifecycle events for one reminder, or the history of
                      one trigger key
  ack [options]       Acknowledge one exact fired reminder Inbox item
  dismiss [options]   Dismiss one exact fired reminder Inbox item
  seal [options]      Seal a local reminder id against destructive actions
  unseal [options]    Remove a local reminder Inbox seal
  trigger [options]   Raise an alert from your own script: the first trigger of
                      a key wakes you; later ones within the merge window are
                      recorded, not sent.
  help [command]      display help for command
",
}
`;

